<title>USA: DRS awarded $64 mln Lockheed contract.</title>
<headline>DRS awarded $64 mln Lockheed contract.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>DRS Technologies Inc said Wednesday it was awarded a contract valued at about $64 million from Lockheed Martin Tactical Defense Systems in Eagan, Minnesota.</p>
<p>The contract calls for the company to manufacture AN/UYQ-70 Advanced Display System tactical workstations for the U.S. Navy.</p>
<p>Production of these commercial systems will be performed by the company's DRS Laurel Technologies unit, located in Johnstown, Pennsylvania.</p>
